        <p>OHLORODYNE is tbe best remedy known for J Coughs, Consumption, Bronchitis and Asthma. CULORODYNE effectually checks and arrests those t,OO often fatal diseases—Diphtheria, Fever, Group, Ague. CEILORODYNE acts like a charm in Diarrhoea and Is the only specific in Cholera and Dysentery. CLILORODYNE effectually cuts abort all attacks of Epilepsy. Hysteria. Palpitation, and Spasms. CHLORODYNE is the only palliative in Neural- Oa, Rheumatism, Gout, Cancer, Toothache, Meningitis, AC.</p>
        <p>From Dr. B. J. BOULTON A.ND Co., Hornaastie. We have made pretty extensive use of Chlorodyne in our practice lately and look upon it as an excellent direct Seda- tive and Anti-spasmodic. It seems to allay pain and irrita- tion In whatever organ, and from whstever cause. It Induces a feeling cf comfort and quietude rot obtainable by any other remedy, and it seems to posses this great advantage over all other sedatives ; that it leaves no unpleasant after effect a. . . .</p>
