      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1901-04-26_WidnesExaminer_art0087" n="art0087">
        <head>Honours for Warrington Soldiers.</head>
        <p>Honours for Warrington Soldiers.</p>
        <p>- —•-- - The names of three lolsl soldiers fig.are conspicuously in the list of honours far services in South Africa. Sergeant Price Private Brighouse, and Private Brackau, of the Prince of Wales' V duateers, South Lancashire Regiment, hsve each been granted a medal for distin- guished conduct in the field. Prior to leaving for the front Sergeant Price was engaged at the works of Messrs Pearson and Knowlee. Elis many friends in the town will be highly pleased Rith the honour he and his COCO- rides have r ceived for gallsut conduct on the battle- field.</p>
